{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54022","headline":"托门媪赠步非烟诗（题拟） · 赵象","name":"托门媪赠步非烟诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十洞三清虽路阻，有心还得傍瑶台。\n瑞香风引思深夜，知是蕊宫仙驭来。\n（均见《太平广记》卷四九一引《三水小牍》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54022.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54022","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}